<html><body><h2>COX-2 inhibitors (example data)</h2><p>288 cyclooxygenase-2 inhibitors with the IC50 values published in four Journal of Medicinal Chemistry papers (1997 and 2000), among them celecoxib. Use it to try the <b>SAR</b> menu: start with <i>SAR &rarr; SAR Overview...</i> and the value column <i>COX-2 IC50 (nM)</i>.</p><p>Source: ChEMBL (https://www.ebi.ac.uk/chembl), target CHEMBL230, documents CHEMBL1130002, CHEMBL1130039, CHEMBL1133457 and CHEMBL1133620. ChEMBL data is made available under the Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 3.0 Unported licence (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0/). One row per molecule and document; values are as recorded in ChEMBL and were not curated further.</p></body></html>
